  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan Distributed Solar Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to finance 43 MW solar photovoltaic (PV) installations for households, agribusinesses, and small and medium enterprises (SMEs) in Pakistan.

&#x2022; The project is expected to be catalytic in establishing self-sustaining solar PV systems industry and scaling of the net-metering market.
&#x2022; GCF provides risk-sharing portfolio guarantee de-risking the 
assumption of higher exposure quantum in the sector by the AE.
&#x2022; Higher assumption of exposure by the AE is expected to stimulate competitive forces in the market, which will contribute to the growth of the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
